@startuml State_Diagram_Alert

title Alert Status State Diagram

[*] --> ACTIVE : Alert Created

ACTIVE --> VERIFIED : confirmations >= 3
ACTIVE --> REJECTED : confidence <= -3
ACTIVE --> EXPIRED : 1 hour passed

VERIFIED --> [*]
REJECTED --> [*]
EXPIRED --> [*]

note right of ACTIVE
  Default state when alert is created
  - Can receive confirmations/denials
  - Confidence score changes
  - Can be deleted by creator
end note

note right of VERIFIED
  Final state (no changes)
  - Alert is legitimate
  - Creator trust score +0.1
  - Visible with verified badge
end note

note right of REJECTED
  Final state (no changes)
  - Alert is false/spam
  - Creator trust score -0.2
  - Hidden from map
end note

note right of EXPIRED
  Final state (no changes)
  - 1 hour timeout
  - No trust score change
  - Auto-cleanup eligible
end note

@enduml

